:58px;\">B</span>\n          <span style=\"position:absolute;left:43px;top:18px;\">$z_1-z_2$</span>\n          <span style=\"position:absolute;left:55px;top:57px;\">$z_1+z_2$</span>\n          <span style=\"position:absolute;left:29px;top:49px;\">90°</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"reason\">\n          <div>∵ $\\overline{OB}$、$\\overline{OA}$的两边分别被对角线垂直平分</div>\n          <div>∴ 斜边到边的距离为相等</div>\n          <div>∴ $\\triangle AOB$为直角三角形</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question q2\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">\n        已知$i$为虚数单位，则$i+i^2+i^3+\\cdots+i^{2019}$等于<span class=\"answer-mark\">D</span>．\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"options\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n        <span>A．$i$</span>\n        <span>B．1</span>\n        <span>C．$-i$</span>\n        <span>D．$-1$</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hand work2\">\n        <div>$i+i^2+i^3+\\cdots+i^{2019}$</div>\n        <div>$=i+i^2+i^3+\\cdots$</div>\n        <div><span class=\"boxed\">$i^4+i^8+i^{12}+\\cdots+i^{2016}=0$</span></div>\n        <div class=\"red rednote\">周期为4，每相邻的4项为0</div>\n        <div>原式$=i+i^2+i^3$</div>\n        <div style=\"margin-left:21px;\">$=-1$</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question q3\">\n      <div class=\"stem\">\n        若复数$z$满足$(3-4i)z=|4+3i|$，则$z$的虚部为<span class=\"answer-mark\">B</span>．\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"options\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n        <span>A．$-4$</span>\n        <span>B．$\\dfrac45$</span>\n        <span>C．$-4i$</span>\n        <span>D．$-\\dfrac45i$</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hand work3\">\n        <div>∵ $(3-4i)z=|4+3i|$</div>\n        <div>∴ $z=\\dfrac{|4+3i|}{3-4i}=\\dfrac5{3-4i}$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=\\dfrac{5(3+4i)}{(3-4i)(3+4i)}$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=\\dfrac35+\\dfrac45i$</div>\n        <div>∴ $\\operatorname{Im}z=$<span class=\"finalbox\">$\\dfrac45$</span>，∴ $z$的虚部为$\\dfrac45$</div>\n        <div class=\"arrow\">→先求出$z$</div>\n        <div class=\"note\">分母、分子同乘$3+4i$<br>的共轭复数</div>\n        <div class=\"note2\">虚部</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
